    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Design your dream space! In this tiny cozy building game, stack and arrange uniquely shaped wooden blocks to craft charming dioramas. Design cozy bakeries, elegant living rooms or quirky studios, create beautiful spaces filled with warmth and personality.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3375490/extras/c4c47d2376011921c9f505632bff3633.avif?t=1754570637\" width=800 height=183 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you\u2019re building a serene bedroom or a vibrant cafe, Block Block Block offers a relaxing, creative space. Experiment with colors, shapes and layouts to make personalized designs that reflect your imagination. Share your dioramas with friends or simply enjoy the soothing satisfaction of bringing your ideas to life.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3375490/extras/5e3014f74221a8c924a4885c057f7fe2.avif?t=1754570637\" width=800 height=183 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With simple drag-and-drop tools and an intuitive interface, Block Block Block makes designing fun and effortless. Whether you\u2019re a casual player or a design enthusiast, enjoy the relaxing satisfaction of creating and sharing your beautiful interiors with friends.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3375490/extras/be978de87bf3f66831ef39c6785694c7.avif?t=1754570637\" width=800 height=183 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Scenes</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Multiple customizable scenes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3375490/extras/525b05060b3fb482922a2fc3ae94bb19.poster.avif?t=1754570637\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3375490/extras/525b05060b3fb482922a2fc3ae94bb19.webm?t=1754570637\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3375490/extras/525b05060b3fb482922a2fc3ae94bb19.mp4?t=1754570637\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Seamless Stacking</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Stack, layer, and arrange items effortlessly to craft intricate designs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3375490/extras/da4cd267afa217600ca5734a1a23533b.poster.avif?t=1754570637\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3375490/extras/da4cd267afa217600ca5734a1a23533b.webm?t=1754570637\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3375490/extras/da4cd267afa217600ca5734a1a23533b.mp4?t=1754570637\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Transform with Ease</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Move, rotate, and scale your items with intuitive controls to achieve the perfect placement.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3375490/extras/aa7f7eb226e992fcacd4939483e7d713.poster.avif?t=1754570637\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3375490/extras/aa7f7eb226e992fcacd4939483e7d713.webm?t=1754570637\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3375490/extras/aa7f7eb226e992fcacd4939483e7d713.mp4?t=1754570637\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Shape your World</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deform select items to reshape them, giving you even more creative flexibility.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3375490/extras/9b5b001e969ed5af0810b5e1714d7837.poster.avif?t=1754570637\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3375490/extras/9b5b001e969ed5af0810b5e1714d7837.webm?t=1754570637\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3375490/extras/9b5b001e969ed5af0810b5e1714d7837.mp4?t=1754570637\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Expressive Customization</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Personalize your items by changing wood types, painting them, and adjusting reflectivity for a polished or rustic look.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3375490/extras/0427cbbe49e0cd991c1ef3d86f8317d6.poster.avif?t=1754570637\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3375490/extras/0427cbbe49e0cd991c1ef3d86f8317d6.webm?t=1754570637\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3375490/extras/0427cbbe49e0cd991c1ef3d86f8317d6.mp4?t=1754570637\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Interactive Realism</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Certain items react just like they would in real life\u2014touch, tilt, or interact to add authentic details to your creations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3375490/extras/3941cf19f4c4054b3a924f7e49ad93fd.poster.avif?t=1754570637\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3375490/extras/3941cf19f4c4054b3a924f7e49ad93fd.webm?t=1754570637\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3375490/extras/3941cf19f4c4054b3a924f7e49ad93fd.mp4?t=1754570637\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Quick Duplication &amp; Randomization</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Duplicate items with ease and apply randomized variations to populate your scenes quickly and natural.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3375490/extras/a00213b41f32b96e407caf54ec6f0bc6.poster.avif?t=1754570637\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3375490/extras/a00213b41f32b96e407caf54ec6f0bc6.webm?t=1754570637\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3375490/extras/a00213b41f32b96e407caf54ec6f0bc6.mp4?t=1754570637\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Studio Mode</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set up cameras to frame, preview, and capture your builds with precision.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3375490/extras/ab19591298860eb64718a81571fbc111.poster.avif?t=1754570637\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3375490/extras/ab19591298860eb64718a81571fbc111.webm?t=1754570637\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3375490/extras/ab19591298860eb64718a81571fbc111.mp4?t=1754570637\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Lighting System</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Add ambient, directional, and item-based lights to bring your creations to life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3375490/extras/c1aafe9cb7e8a0432f8d2a228ce22e54.poster.avif?t=1754570637\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3375490/extras/c1aafe9cb7e8a0432f8d2a228ce22e54.webm?t=1754570637\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3375490/extras/c1aafe9cb7e8a0432f8d2a228ce22e54.mp4?t=1754570637\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Design your dream space! In this tiny cozy building game, stack and arrange uniquely shaped wooden blocks to craft charming dioramas. Design cozy bakeries, elegant living rooms or quirky studios, create beautiful spaces filled with warmth and personality.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3375490/extras/c4c47d2376011921c9f505632bff3633.avif?t=1754570637\" width=800 height=183 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you\u2019re building a serene bedroom or a vibrant cafe, Block Block Block offers a relaxing, creative space. Experiment with colors, shapes and layouts to make personalized designs that reflect your imagination. Share your dioramas with friends or simply enjoy the soothing satisfaction of bringing your ideas to life.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3375490/extras/5e3014f74221a8c924a4885c057f7fe2.avif?t=1754570637\" width=800 height=183 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With simple drag-and-drop tools and an intuitive interface, Block Block Block makes designing fun and effortless. Whether you\u2019re a casual player or a design enthusiast, enjoy the relaxing satisfaction of creating and sharing your beautiful interiors with friends.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3375490/extras/be978de87bf3f66831ef39c6785694c7.avif?t=1754570637\" width=800 height=183 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Scenes</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Multiple customizable scenes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3375490/extras/525b05060b3fb482922a2fc3ae94bb19.poster.avif?t=1754570637\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3375490/extras/525b05060b3fb482922a2fc3ae94bb19.webm?t=1754570637\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3375490/extras/525b05060b3fb482922a2fc3ae94bb19.mp4?t=1754570637\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Seamless Stacking</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Stack, layer, and arrange items effortlessly to craft intricate designs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3375490/extras/da4cd267afa217600ca5734a1a23533b.poster.avif?t=1754570637\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3375490/extras/da4cd267afa217600ca5734a1a23533b.webm?t=1754570637\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3375490/extras/da4cd267afa217600ca5734a1a23533b.mp4?t=1754570637\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Transform with Ease</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Move, rotate, and scale your items with intuitive controls to achieve the perfect placement.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3375490/extras/aa7f7eb226e992fcacd4939483e7d713.poster.avif?t=1754570637\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3375490/extras/aa7f7eb226e992fcacd4939483e7d713.webm?t=1754570637\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3375490/extras/aa7f7eb226e992fcacd4939483e7d713.mp4?t=1754570637\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Shape your World</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deform select items to reshape them, giving you even more creative flexibility.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3375490/extras/9b5b001e969ed5af0810b5e1714d7837.poster.avif?t=1754570637\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3375490/extras/9b5b001e969ed5af0810b5e1714d7837.webm?t=1754570637\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3375490/extras/9b5b001e969ed5af0810b5e1714d7837.mp4?t=1754570637\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Expressive Customization</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Personalize your items by changing wood types, painting them, and adjusting reflectivity for a polished or rustic look.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3375490/extras/0427cbbe49e0cd991c1ef3d86f8317d6.poster.avif?t=1754570637\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3375490/extras/0427cbbe49e0cd991c1ef3d86f8317d6.webm?t=1754570637\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3375490/extras/0427cbbe49e0cd991c1ef3d86f8317d6.mp4?t=1754570637\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Interactive Realism</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Certain items react just like they would in real life\u2014touch, tilt, or interact to add authentic details to your creations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3375490/extras/3941cf19f4c4054b3a924f7e49ad93fd.poster.avif?t=1754570637\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3375490/extras/3941cf19f4c4054b3a924f7e49ad93fd.webm?t=1754570637\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3375490/extras/3941cf19f4c4054b3a924f7e49ad93fd.mp4?t=1754570637\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Quick Duplication &amp; Randomization</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Duplicate items with ease and apply randomized variations to populate your scenes quickly and natural.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3375490/extras/a00213b41f32b96e407caf54ec6f0bc6.poster.avif?t=1754570637\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3375490/extras/a00213b41f32b96e407caf54ec6f0bc6.webm?t=1754570637\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3375490/extras/a00213b41f32b96e407caf54ec6f0bc6.mp4?t=1754570637\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Studio Mode</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set up cameras to frame, preview, and capture your builds with precision.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3375490/extras/ab19591298860eb64718a81571fbc111.poster.avif?t=1754570637\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3375490/extras/ab19591298860eb64718a81571fbc111.webm?t=1754570637\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3375490/extras/ab19591298860eb64718a81571fbc111.mp4?t=1754570637\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Lighting System</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Add ambient, directional, and item-based lights to bring your creations to life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3375490/extras/c1aafe9cb7e8a0432f8d2a228ce22e54.poster.avif?t=1754570637\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3375490/extras/c1aafe9cb7e8a0432f8d2a228ce22e54.webm?t=1754570637\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3375490/extras/c1aafe9cb7e8a0432f8d2a228ce22e54.mp4?t=1754570637\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
